00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:16.576
I prepped a little bit

00:00:16.576 --> 00:00:18.503
up until I started drinking beers,

00:00:18.503 --> 00:00:19.943
then I had some fish tacos,

00:00:19.943 --> 00:00:21.294
