00:00:21.294 --> 00:00:24.057
- I've struggled with my weight
since I was in second grade.

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:25.589
I'm now 23.

00:00:26.069 --> 00:00:29.161
And since about January, I've
taken a serious investment

00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:30.512
