in touch with my body,

00:03:07.867 --> 00:03:09.307
but it was a good exercise.

00:03:09.307 --> 00:03:12.000
- I don't think a three day
long juice cleanse is for me.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.116
I already eat a really
healthy and balanced diet

00:03:15.116 --> 00:03:16.300
that includes a lot of vegetables

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.647
and already includes juice.

00:03:17.647 --> 00:03:20.697
- The past three days
were the right kind of

00:03:20.697 --> 00:03:24.064
