start eating healthy again.

00:03:24.064 --> 00:03:26.363
- The one thing I think
it did help me with

00:03:26.363 --> 00:03:27.431
was discipline.

00:03:27.431 --> 00:03:28.987
You can say no to those snacks.

00:03:28.987 --> 00:03:31.285
You can say no to that soda.

00:03:31.285 --> 00:03:32.934
- I am drinking juice today.

00:03:32.934 --> 00:03:34.397
I do kinda miss it.

00:03:34.397 --> 00:03:36.166
- Juice cleanses have
their time and place.

00:03:36.166 --> 00:03:40.874
("All Funky All Fresh" by
Warner/Chappell Production Music)

